{
"file": 1,
"paths": [
"d002/f581"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "595cbf71",
"en_raw": "Taking Shiina's story"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "484ba181",
"en_raw": "all together..."
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "55e12497",
"en_raw": "......."
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "739795a9",
"en_raw": "Hey Nao, anyway"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "8375ace1",
"en_raw": "What's a killer clown supposed to be?"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "d1efcf5d",
"en_raw": "Don't ask me, I don't know"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "2cf2f666",
"en_raw": "Kurumi knows!"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "1c2a76a4",
"en_raw": "A clown, a clown is"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "c24edefa",
"en_raw": "A circus person! Bingo!"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "7ecf472b",
"en_raw": "Kurumi has never seen a"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "6c41f97e",
"en_raw": "real clown, you know"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "cf1bd619",
"en_raw": "I'm guessing it's a patient who"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "c72937c7",
"en_raw": "escaped from the hospital, though"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "ffde8765",
"en_raw": "As for the killing part..."
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "fe5a45ca",
"en_raw": "Well, you know"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "194eeb52",
"en_raw": "But Sango, what if it's real?"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "0ed76e3b",
"en_raw": "It'll be fine"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "01c92ce6",
"en_raw": "There are three of us"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "7c9d7748",
"en_raw": "and Melos too"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "6f57fd24",
"en_raw": "And if you're still scared, Nao"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "080246d4",
"en_raw": "arm yourself with a raw carrot?"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "63b1b0b3",
"en_raw": "Above the parking lot at the foot of the hill"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "0586ab6d",
"en_raw": "there's a weird building, right?"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "a8c6d7b6",
"en_raw": "That seems to be the new hospital"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "d3388e04",
"en_raw": "Huh, I didn't know there was one"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "a7b5ec5d",
"en_raw": "The old hospital ruins are"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "3c2ac4e3",
"en_raw": "supposedly behind it"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "1b8a2c93",
"en_raw": "And that's where the killer clown"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "0fd0578d",
"en_raw": "lives, then"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "3e42262f",
"en_raw": "...Sango"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "2bf231ea",
"en_raw": "Did you bring a carrot?"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "51e5e1c8",
"en_raw": "Yeah, got it, got it"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "f0e04aff",
"en_raw": "Nao, did you see?"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "dfecc2b0",
"en_raw": "The way that doctor looked at Shiina..."
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "067820f1",
"en_raw": "He was definitely watching Shiina"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "6189ea71",
"en_raw": "An evil gaze twisted with desire"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "68f1ca20",
"en_raw": "Huh?"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "2d08435c",
"en_raw": "...It's him"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "1fa65a7a",
"en_raw": "What is?"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "a5983b1d",
"en_raw": "The killer clown's true identity"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "cb8c348c",
"en_raw": "That pervert doctor"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "7acb4ecb",
"en_raw": "is kidnapping and killing people"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "e2b559ad",
"en_raw": "Probably dressed up as a clown"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "ec90479a",
"en_raw": "And his next prey is..."
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "b879ef2b",
"en_raw": "Hey hey, clown! Clown!"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "a3721fcd",
"en_raw": "...No way"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "bdc0fbb6",
"en_raw": "Let's go back again tomorrow"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "18963108",
"en_raw": "There's definitely something there"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "b156f487",
"en_raw": "Beyond that, in the old hospital's"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "ea728246",
"en_raw": "so-called basement"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "7797914b",
"en_raw": "It's weird, totally weird"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "3ef8061a",
"en_raw": "If that's not weird"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "e20f7532",
"en_raw": "what else could possibly be weird?"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "cc1aeeed",
"en_raw": "What do you mean?"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "4189b82e",
"en_raw": "Obviously"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "464685bf",
"en_raw": "That doctor's attitude"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "3752ed8b",
"en_raw": "toward Shiina"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "9b388894",
"en_raw": "Wasn't he awfully nice?"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "cc94bcdf",
"en_raw": "I guess..."
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "6a239a54",
"en_raw": "It's weird, it's weird"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "895b918d",
"en_raw": "...Anyway, let's sleep on it tonight"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "9726b112",
"en_raw": "and get our thoughts in order"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "906b2953",
"en_raw": "What are you going to do?"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "71e45501",
"en_raw": "What do you mean, what am I going to do?"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "4189b82e",
"en_raw": "Obviously"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "0afd0e6b",
"en_raw": "Get the evidence and"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "4330fed5",
"en_raw": "hand him over to the police"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "96ab8b85",
"en_raw": "...So this is the rumored random killer"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "be6d3ba7",
"en_raw": "the killer clown, huh"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "5365285a",
"en_raw": "But did anyone actually get killed?"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "9106aa57",
"en_raw": "Dunno, somebody"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "b36a85eb",
"en_raw": "But there's no evidence, is there?"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "07e468a2",
"en_raw": "That's why the evidence"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "cbef742c",
"en_raw": "is down in that basement, I'm telling you"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "e543f5b9",
"en_raw": "Wait, Sango"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "1fd4dc86",
"en_raw": "This is crazy"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "f874da20",
"en_raw": "I mean, if he were a real killer"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "96f0083f",
"en_raw": "when we were in the basement"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "78ed3b11",
"en_raw": "why didn't he come in?"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "5af33fda",
"en_raw": "There were intruders where the evidence is"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "9b29c52c",
"en_raw": "Hesitating is strange"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "a683fa51",
"en_raw": "He could have just locked us in"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "62574252",
"en_raw": "right there"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "b3618530",
"en_raw": "But that man didn't even do that..."
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "4a99665a",
"en_raw": "What are you trying to say?"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "511f4fd7",
"en_raw": "I don't know, but..."
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "c3a8a58e",
"en_raw": "I think Sango is fundamentally"
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "85f3a3ab",
"en_raw": "wrong about this"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "37ce458b",
"en_raw": "Then Inspector Murase..."
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "906b2953",
"en_raw": "What are you going to do?"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "1fff80d6",
"en_raw": "I'll ask, I'll go ask"
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "8d1cdcda",
"en_raw": "...that doctor"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "be24a452",
"en_raw": "No way, you're brave"
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "115e2c0f",
"en_raw": "Even if you're about to be killed"
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "79df7385",
"en_raw": "I won't help you, you know"
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "e84e1f3a",
"en_raw": "If it were me"
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "02b5588a",
"en_raw": "I'd quietly report it to the police"
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "5929222b",
"en_raw": "There's no way a killer exists"
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "3ba2f789",
"en_raw": "I'll prove it"
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "b0ea7a40",
"en_raw": "That he's just a normal person"
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "b494d05f",
"en_raw": "You'll definitely get killed"
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "1a4d7857",
"en_raw": "I won't get killed"
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "d496f6ac",
"en_raw": "Because I"
},
{
"n": 103,
"h": "d8b03d4c",
"en_raw": "was locked in there"
},
{
"n": 104,
"h": "049e7340",
"en_raw": "No, you've got it wrong"
},
{
"n": 105,
"h": "0c01bab3",
"en_raw": "That doctor explained"
},
{
"n": 106,
"h": "00f270c6",
"en_raw": "everything that happened"
},
{
"n": 107,
"h": "fe247a09",
"en_raw": "But that look he gave Shiina..."
},
{
"n": 108,
"h": "401404c1",
"en_raw": "I just couldn't ask about that"
},
{
"n": 109,
"h": "bd73721a",
"en_raw": "When Sango collapsed"
},
{
"n": 110,
"h": "736d1859",
"en_raw": "Shiina was there too"
},
{
"n": 111,
"h": "0dcf3cae",
"en_raw": "and he was perfectly normal"
},
{
"n": 112,
"h": "2dacd1c5",
"en_raw": "There's no way that's true!"
},
{
"n": 113,
"h": "2429ac07",
"en_raw": "That's rude, Sango"
},
{
"n": 114,
"h": "7ba9677c",
"en_raw": "Fine..."
},
{
"n": 115,
"h": "874dafac",
"en_raw": "If you're going to say that, Nao"
},
{
"n": 116,
"h": "d3d4a0b2",
"en_raw": "go by yourself"
},
{
"n": 117,
"h": "06690cd5",
"en_raw": "I only caught"
},
{
"n": 118,
"h": "b885d653",
"en_raw": "part of it, but"
},
{
"n": 119,
"h": "c30ea6ad",
"en_raw": "Still, that explains"
},
{
"n": 120,
"h": "18253633",
"en_raw": "the doctor's attitude"
},
{
"n": 121,
"h": "59f2daab",
"en_raw": "toward Shiina, maybe"
},
{
"n": 122,
"h": "9e107103",
"en_raw": "A girl who died long ago"
},
{
"n": 123,
"h": "59e54a61",
"en_raw": "who looks like Shiina..."
},
{
"n": 124,
"h": "449adea0",
"en_raw": "Oh well"
},
{
"n": 125,
"h": "78d1316d",
"en_raw": "I'll stop overthinking it"
},
{
"n": 126,
"h": "8eb541cf",
"en_raw": "Let's go home for today"
},
{
"n": 127,
"h": "3c3a1a3b",
"en_raw": "The killer clown is a toy clown"
},
{
"n": 128,
"h": "82431e40",
"en_raw": "But I bet he doesn't exist"
},
{
"n": 129,
"h": "2091e376",
"en_raw": "Something wonderful like"
},
{
"n": 130,
"h": "80f459d6",
"en_raw": "a killer clown..."
},
{
"n": 131,
"h": "c6444448",
"en_raw": "Hey Sango, that doctor"
},
{
"n": 132,
"h": "1569be6d",
"en_raw": "said 'curse', didn't he?"
},
{
"n": 133,
"h": "9139236f",
"en_raw": "Maybe he did"
},
{
"n": 134,
"h": "e323b65c",
"en_raw": "Do adults fear curses too?"
},
{
"n": 135,
"h": "248de521",
"en_raw": "Don't you get it?"
},
{
"n": 136,
"h": "49650848",
"en_raw": "It was just a way of putting it"
},
{
"n": 137,
"h": "8118ec53",
"en_raw": "...Death by professional negligence?"
},
{
"n": 138,
"h": "43fde05d",
"en_raw": "He's troubled about that"
},
{
"n": 139,
"h": "751a801e",
"en_raw": "and that's what he called a curse"
},
{
"n": 140,
"h": "65a9692d",
"en_raw": "It's an expression, an expression"
},
{
"n": 141,
"h": "f3ef74e6",
"en_raw": "Then it has nothing to do"
},
{
"n": 142,
"h": "99c2e8b0",
"en_raw": "with Shiina, right?"
},
{
"n": 143,
"h": "92b62344",
"en_raw": "He said so himself, didn't he?"
},
{
"n": 144,
"h": "443050c6",
"en_raw": "...Then we"
},
{
"n": 145,
"h": "e008c6e8",
"en_raw": "totally got it wrong"
},
{
"n": 146,
"h": "9e7fe8fa",
"en_raw": "What?"
},
{
"n": 147,
"h": "3c3d0ecf",
"en_raw": "You say 'we', but"
},
{
"n": 148,
"h": "1fd59e34",
"en_raw": "what's with that critical look"
},
{
"n": 149,
"h": "4b01bdf0",
"en_raw": "aimed only at me?"
},
{
"n": 150,
"h": "7d2e47c1",
"en_raw": "At least let's go apologize"
},
{
"n": 151,
"h": "11112b80",
"en_raw": "to that doctor"
},
{
"n": 152,
"h": "d4cff1de",
"en_raw": "Why did that doctor"
},
{
"n": 153,
"h": "a9daef97",
"en_raw": "end up like that?"
},
{
"n": 154,
"h": "26d1ce3c",
"en_raw": "Surely it's not our fault"
},
{
"n": 155,
"h": "10188a6f",
"en_raw": "right?"
},
{
"n": 156,
"h": "6ae51c1d",
"en_raw": "Kurumi wanted to see a"
},
{
"n": 157,
"h": "76549556",
"en_raw": "real clown..."
},
{
"n": 158,
"h": "05b04f90",
"en_raw": "Hey Nao, say something"
},
{
"n": 159,
"h": "55e12497",
"en_raw": "......."
},
{
"n": 160,
"h": "327f247d",
"en_raw": "What's wrong, Nao?"
},
{
"n": 161,
"h": "f5097387",
"en_raw": "(A girl died thirteen years ago)"
},
{
"n": 162,
"h": "39fc4d8b",
"en_raw": "(...That's true)"
},
{
"n": 163,
"h": "27c45c1f",
"en_raw": "(She died in some well)"
},
{
"n": 164,
"h": "39fc4d8b",
"en_raw": "(...That's true)"
},
{
"n": 165,
"h": "6429f1d1",
"en_raw": "(She looks like Shiina)"
},
{
"n": 166,
"h": "3ac6aed5",
"en_raw": "(...Probably true)"
},
{
"n": 167,
"h": "cc3b72e8",
"en_raw": "(But that's all"
},
{
"n": 168,
"h": "5d8f5650",
"en_raw": "It has nothing to do with us)"
},
{
"n": 169,
"h": "efacdb49",
"en_raw": "(...But)"
},
{
"n": 170,
"h": "1aa220ab",
"en_raw": "...What's wrong?"
},
{
"n": 171,
"h": "2417e56f",
"en_raw": "You look so serious"
},
{
"n": 172,
"h": "e9d27008",
"en_raw": "No, it's nothing"
},
{
"n": 173,
"h": "1098b9bf",
"en_raw": "Anyway, I'm"
},
{
"n": 174,
"h": "d8056c22",
"en_raw": "not going back there"
},
{
"n": 175,
"h": "09d11d70",
"en_raw": "Clown or no clown"
},
{
"n": 176,
"h": "63e3ccad",
"en_raw": "Solved the rumor of the Killer Clown"
},
{
"n": 177,
"h": "ceef4bb3",
"en_raw": "Anyway, the killer clown is a hoax"
},
{
"n": 178,
"h": "10a094f3",
"en_raw": "Carrots have nothing to do with it"
},
{
"n": 179,
"h": "975d04ac",
"en_raw": "So that's why this story"
},
{
"n": 180,
"h": "238aaf90",
"en_raw": "is over now"
},
{
"n": 181,
"h": "4ec18982",
"en_raw": "Kurumi didn't see a clown"
},
{
"n": 182,
"h": "e52c04d3",
"en_raw": "Sorry, but this story"
},
{
"n": 183,
"h": "646644bd",
"en_raw": "I don't want to remember it"
},
{
"n": 184,
"h": "14f5784c",
"en_raw": "Enough, drop it"
},
{
"n": 185,
"h": "da16b673",
"en_raw": "Let's talk about something else already!"
}
]
}